{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000573","bookName":"Arrodíllense ante la Reina de la Venganza","cover":"","viewCount":2346318,"followCount":38228,"introduction":"La oficial Mireya murió en acción y despertó en el cuerpo de Mireia, la verdadera heredera de los Serrano. Su nueva vida no era mejor: maltratada por su madrastra, despreciada por sus padres biológicos y acosada por Camila, la falsa heredera, terminó muriendo trágicamente. Ahora, Mireya decide vengarse y, mientras investiga al Grupo Serrano, descubre que la causa de su muerte esconde un misterio aún mayor… justo cuando Diego, su amor de infancia, regresa.","chapterCount":83,"labels":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"tags":["Strong Female Lead","Revenge"],"typeTwoIds":[335],"typeTwoNames":["Venganza"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":335,"name":"Venganza","replaceName":"venganza"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Venganza","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Arrodíllense-ante-la-Reina-de-la-Venganza","bookNameLower":"arrodíllense-ante-la-reina-de-la-venganza","shelfTime":"2025-11-24 10:00:03","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-24 10:00:03","performerList":[{"performerId":"27128","performerName":"Ningning Chi","performerFormatName":"Ningning-Chi","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x2/27128/27128.jpg?time=1785749028495","videoCount":0},{"performerId":"19800","performerName":"Zhiwei Zhang","performerFormatName":"Zhiwei-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x0/19800/19800.jpg?time=1790152513701","videoCount":0}],"performerIdList":[19800,27128]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700036458","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":212617,"price":0},{"id":"700036459","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":134963,"price":0},{"id":"700036460","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":119475,"price":0},{"id":"700036461","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":117278,"price":0},{"id":"700036462","index":4,"unlock":true,"m